    assess and mitigate such risks, but also to communicate how risks are being handled and how
    such projects may benefit Morocco as well as local communities. Informing and consulting local
    stakeholders early on in developing hydrogen projects can help create buy-in and support and
    ensure hydrogen and green fuel projects do not crowd out or limit existing ecosystem and space use.
