    be equally relevant for all four ports. For example, monitoring the development of fertilizer prices
    and demand will be most pertinent for Jorf Lasfar.

•   Hydrogen pipeline infrastructure studies: Monitor research into developing a national network
    of hydrogen pipelines and transformed gas pipelines in order to ensure possible connections with
    ports and port industrial zones are considered.

